|Risk                                            |Likelihood / impact|Mitigation                                                                          |
|------------------------------------------------|-------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Hackathon terms bar reused implementation       |Unknown / critical |Verify official terms before copying code; document new work and references         |
